{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 152979, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 102684, "uid": 107952, "type": 4, "title": "💜夏娃的冒险💜搬运+个人理解の简单攻略", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1648637314, "updated_at": 1655664675, "updated_uid": 107952, "comment_at": 1688490229, "last_at": 1691840075, "comment_count": 57, "status": 1, "summary": "更新记录2022/06/20优化一下排版没什么更新。2022/03/30鉴于国际服马上要实装夏娃的冒险了而我在wiki也没有搜到夏娃的冒险的攻略我就来简单写一点很多内容是在韩服群里大佬分享的攻略外加贴", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/107952/2022/2/30/277877.png,//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/347j75/1_9cdUd018bng1q5nk6t6my55i_pudfux.png?type=w660,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/107952/2022/3/9/430312.PNG", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 31, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 54656, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 26, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 152979, "content": "<div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">更新记录</span></div></div><br></div><div>2022/06/20</div><div>优化一下排版没什么更新。</div><div>2022/03/30</div><div>鉴于国际服马上要实装夏娃的冒险了而我在wiki也没有搜到夏娃的冒险的攻略我就来简单写一点</div><div>很多内容是在韩服群里大佬分享的攻略外加贴吧看到的</div><div>我不知道是哪个大佬做的图 侵删= =</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">简介：</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;夏娃的冒险是dc内置的一款类<span style=\"\">Roguelike爬塔</span>小游戏</span></span></div><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div></div></span><div><span style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">背景：</span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;讲述了夏娃在没有里欧导航的情况下去寻找赛美勒途中发生的小剧场。</span></div><span style=\"\"><div><br></div><div><span style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">入口：</span></div></div><br></span></div></span></span></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/347jbh/a_cccUd018bngopjvdu1buzpx_tagck3.png?type=w660\" alt=\"命運之子: FAQ - 💜夏娃的冒險內容說明 image 3\" style=\"height: 82px; width: 156.312px;\" data-width=\"305\" data-height=\"160\"><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">主要玩法：</span></div></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"\"></span></div></div></span></span><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/107952/2022/2/30/277877.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/107952/2022/2/30/277877.png\" style=\"height: 446.709px; width: 217.989px;\" data-width=\"427\" data-height=\"875\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;控制方向键操作夏娃移动；点击攻击键攻击敌人；点击药水键使用药水；</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;菜单键进入人物属性、背包、</span><span style=\"\">合成台、帮助以及退出，</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;击杀敌人/打开宝箱后随机获取金币装备；升级后获取属性加点；</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;通过一定层数会遇到玛门（猪皇）的商店可以买药水或者装备。</span></div></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">国际服的常驻奖励：</span></span></div></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/107952/2022/2/30/680913.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/107952/2022/2/30/680913.png\" data-width=\"563\" data-height=\"348\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">（不用想了只能完成一次）</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"><br></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">已结束活动 仅做记录</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);text-decoration-line:line-through;\">新活动：在4月14日前完成26层夏娃的冒险会获得奖励</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line:line-through;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;text-decoration-line:line-through;\">其实还有个活动 但是需要绑定fb，但是绑定fb有时候会因为ip问题莫名其妙的fb封号，谨慎操作，</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;text-decoration-line:line-through;\">非要薅这个羊毛也请多绑定几个登录方式。</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;text-decoration-line:line-through;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">详情见<span style=\"\">https://moot.us/lounges/240/boards/1151/posts/5444569/2</span></span><span style=\"\"></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/107952/2022/3/2/330764.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/107952/2022/3/2/330764.png\" data-width=\"540\" data-height=\"268\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">活动已结束</div></span></div><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"></div>\n                               </div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">攻略：</span></div></div></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;最简单粗暴的攻略就是加点<span style=\"color: rgb(239, 13, 13);\">全部堆防御</span>，<span style=\"font-size: 12px; text-decoration-line: line-through;\">（三防核心！肉装夏娃就对了！！）</span>堆到<span style=\"color: rgb(239, 13, 13);\">50</span>或<span style=\"color: rgb(239, 13, 13);\">60</span>&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;之后要多</span><span style=\"color: rgb(13, 239, 17);\">补充敏捷属性和HP</span><span style=\"\">，避免你攻击时的miss情况，为什么推荐点HP之后会说</span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">，</span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;防御拉满了药是溢出的，可以多带点预防毒箱子。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">有的箱子会带毒，吃毒以后玩家行动就受到伤害，一定行动次数后会自己解毒，还有传送宝箱，其实就是给你瞬移到同层的其他地方。</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; （</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-decoration-line: line-through;\">好家伙夏娃你成天在jjc当毒王真是天道好轮回！）</span></span></div></span><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"> &nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">那么如何刷出那么多防御呢？</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;这就不得不大喊三声：SL大法好；SL大法好；SL大法好；</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 0px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;商</span><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"> &nbsp;sl</span>：的是save or load，退出再进，比如你这次没刷出来防御提升就直接退，下次也许就有了，属于是玩有随机性游戏的常用技巧了，和远古时期自建号刷初始5星是一个道理。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;注意：</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration-line: underline;\">在夏娃小游戏的菜单里面退出就可以，不用大退。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;sl不限于刷属性、打boss刷掉落<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">（没记错的话有的boss层会出俩装备）</span>&nbsp;、操作失误挽救一下之类的</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"//bang-phinf.pstatic.net/a/347j75/1_9cdUd018bng1q5nk6t6my55i_pudfux.png?type=w660\" alt=\"命運之子: FAQ - 💜夏娃的冒險內容說明 image 15\" data-width=\"660\" data-height=\"780\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;height:455.808px;width:385.695px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;这几天看群里聊天，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">有些人在刷够防御的情况下</span>&nbsp;面对26层最终boss时，还是被boss秒杀了/或者打不过boss，这是因为<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">26层boss的属性也是随机的</span>，<span style=\"color: rgb(235, 9, 9);\">很有可能你遇到了一个点满穿透和暴击的boss，上来就给你秒了。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(235,9,9);\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(235,9,9);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;所以在你点够防御的情况下打26层时候，发现自己在掉血，就马上sl，直到刷出一个菜鸡bos</span><span style=\"\">（指打你不掉血或者刮痧）</span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(235,9,9);font-weight:700;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;还有人反应26层的boss可以打出100+的高额爆发，<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">连sl的机会都没有</span>，所以在平时加点时</span><span style=\"color:rgb(235,9,9);font-weight:700;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(235, 9, 9); font-weight: 700;\">防御＞敏捷≥生命＞其他</span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(235, 9, 9); font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;等你有了200左右的hp的时候，也不至于会被boss一击秒杀，打不过可以发动SL<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: 700; text-align: left;\">（败者食尘！！）</span>，要是还被秒了，我只能说：</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">酋长</span><span style=\"color: rgb(235, 9, 9); font-weight: 700;\">重新来过吧...</span></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(235, 9, 9); font-weight: 700;\"></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"></div></span></span><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left; font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">辛辛苦苦的sl被boss一击打败！这不就是《夏娃之魂》吗！！</span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left; font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><br></span></span></div></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;装备是可以在菜单界面合成的，可以提前攒奶枪，商店可以用货币刷新，高层商店有概率刷出高级装备。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;当你手握奶枪，</span><span style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 600;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">因为怕疼所以就全点防御了<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">（不是）<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">之后</span>，<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">你就可以横着走了</span></span></span></span><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 36px; font-weight: 600;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(166, 41, 195);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/107952/2022/3/9/430312.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/107952/2022/3/9/430312.PNG\" style=\"height: 815.803px; width: 376.961px;\" data-width=\"1170\" data-height=\"2532\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(166,41,195);font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(166,41,195);font-weight:600;text-align:center;font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">即使没有里欧这小子带路夏娃大人也随便逛大街！</span></span><br></div><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">装备合成</span></span></div></div><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">感谢黑大更新的国际服合成公式。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">最上面这件是奶枪</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">合成公式</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\">转自<span style=\"\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/17o4GO5kLT4FT2PRJMmcCT0mVGQrn6lASi0nz9v2BOn8/edit#gid=1559779700</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/15803/2022/3/7/519752.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/15803/2022/3/7/519752.jpg\" data-width=\"1754\" data-height=\"1239\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/15803/2022/3/7/742072.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/15803/2022/3/7/742072.jpg\" data-width=\"1754\" data-height=\"1239\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/15803/2022/3/7/568955.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/15803/2022/3/7/568955.jpg\" data-width=\"1754\" data-height=\"1239\"></div></div>\n                               </div><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>一般情况下做出奶枪，防御加点有个40，敏捷hp稍微点下都是足够了，奶枪自带10防御150血</span><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:left;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">一些用处不大的小技巧＆心得：</span></div></div></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;升级会满血，玩过老式rpg的人都有熟悉的感觉了吧</span><br></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;使用血药的时候，有 时停 不会受到伤害<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（砸瓦鲁多）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;奶枪是最好的武器了<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（实际上在小游戏外也算个t0.75了！）</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;差一点经</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">验升级的时候，可以跳过几个怪直接进入下一层，这样方便你sl</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;吃毒了别吝啬血药，乱走赌命然后暴毙的人也不少</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;在商店sl是返回上一层</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;有些时候太纠结sl的属性会让你打的非常慢且痛苦，比如一层两次加点刷出一次防御就好了不用一直sl，当然了强迫症、完美党或者慎勇人随意了。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div></span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（小游戏里的人物属性和DC的属性是差不多的，不会还有人不知道白敏是干嘛的吧！）</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">部分怪物情况</span></span></div></div></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;\">这些也是韩服群友发的，不知道是哪个大佬做的，</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">侵删-3-</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/107952/2022/2/30/295105.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/107952/2022/2/30/295105.png\" data-width=\"1061\" data-height=\"663\"></div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">尾言</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;预祝大家旗开得胜，一次获取奖励吧！</span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;有需要改的地方大家可以提出来 我会实时更新</span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;也有玩家说全点敏捷也能通关，夏娃x火击剑√，也欢迎大家分享自己的玩法</span></div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 夏娃活动</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">达比任务领取的武器别喂了</span><span style=\"\">，其中血攻武器拉满有801hp可以说是奶枪promax了，属于是船新的辅助/盾天子的毕业武器了，攻防武器也是目前独一家，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">给盾辅也是非常不错的。竞技场商店遇到血剑不要错过了</span></span></span></span></div></span></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;text-align:left;\"></span></span><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"font-si